          "claim": "Another construction tagged with a FLAG sequence into the S1\u2013S2 external loop of the K V 1.5 (between residues 307 and 308) of the K V \u03b21.3\u2013IRES\u2013K V 1.5 cDNA was obtained by the overlapping PCR technique ( Table 1 ) previously described [ 43 ]."
