  "literature_notes": "L2 (HA tag, KV\u03b21.3\u2013IRES\u2013KV1.5\u2013HA) was evaluated but does not qualify: the clip describes a restriction-enzyme (BlpI/AflII) cDNA swap with no residue position stated, making it impossible to pin insert_after_residue or confirm the tag is extracellular. The conventional 'KV1.5-HA' naming suggests a C-terminal tag, which would be intracellular (residues 516\u2013613), but this is inference, not evidence. L3 (PMC185199) was evaluated but does not qualify: it reports an antibody that recognises an extracellular epitope in the S1\u2013S2 linker of Kv1.5 on live, non-permeabilised cells. Per the rules, antibody epitope mapping \u2014 where an antibody binds \u2014 is not evidence of where a tag was inserted, and L3 is therefore excluded. No other ledger lines were provided.",
